All 4 items render from the page chrome (sourced from Localizable.xcstrings with web key
names) over the hosted `InboxBody` surface bound to its @Observable InboxBodyModel (ADR-004 —
no networking in the view). Data sources: the page passes vehicles + rules into the body via
the seeded InboxUpdate (web `useVehicles` + `useAlertRules`, the two declared data sources),
and InboxBody consumes the notification feed through its InboxSource seam.

DATA STATES (spec: loading / empty / error for the source): all four InboxBody list phases —
loading (InboxLoadingView), error (InboxErrorView + Retry), empty (InboxEmptyView, archived-
aware), content (InboxListView) — are implemented by the hosted component (InboxBody.swift
`listContent`); the page seeds `.content`. a11y: page title/subtitle combined element, copy +
toggle labelled, InboxBody contributes its own surface a11y label + per-row traits; Dynamic
Type via Font.TS roles; light/dark + increased-contrast via Color.TS dynamic tokens. Adaptive
macOS/iPad (regular) header HStack vs iPhone (compact) VStack via horizontalSizeClass.
SI converters: N/A — inbox metadata (titles/messages/timestamps) is unit-agnostic control-
plane data; InboxBody formats timestamps at the display boundary. Live-SSE staleness: the
hosted InboxBody surfaces the >2-min freshness chrome (InboxConnection .stale/.offline,
ADR-013); the sample seeds .live.

